gtm-work — data provenance notice

All fixtures under fixtures/ are hand-authored synthetic data, except fixtures/crmarena_sample/ and
fixtures/evals/crmarena/. Company and person names in the hand-authored fixtures (Acme, Beta,
Northstar, Priya, Marco, ...) are fictional.

fixtures/crmarena_sample/ is a small excerpt (three accounts) of the CRMArena-Pro B2B Salesforce org
by Salesforce AI Research: third-party synthetic data, licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL USE
ONLY). Attribution and changes are listed in fixtures/crmarena_sample/README.md. That licence covers
those files only; they must not be shipped in a commercial product.

fixtures/evals/crmarena/ holds the CRMArena eval gold (HAR-114 gold v2): 55 eval cases that quote
verbatim excerpts of records from the same CRMArena-Pro org (emails, tasks, contacts, quotes and
contracts of real current deals). The excerpts are third-party synthetic data by Salesforce AI Research,
licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY). The authored candidate actions, state notes and labels
in those files are ours; the quoted records are not. Attribution and changes: fixtures/evals/crmarena/
README.md. bench/labels/crmarena/ holds the labelling passes and label metadata for those cases (judgments
and our own rationales; no record text beyond short phrases) and carries the same constraint wherever it
quotes case text. They are NOT for use in, or shipping with, a commercial product.

web/tests/fixtures/core/medtech.* and web/tests/fixtures/medtech/ hold the web demo case MedTech Advances
(the rank-1 case of bench/reports/demo-cases-2026-10-04.md): the account, deal, people and 13 events of one
deal of the same CRMArena-Pro org, with the deal's 8 emails verbatim in medtech.source-emails.json. Those
records are third-party synthetic data by Salesforce AI Research, licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL USE
ONLY). The strategies, eval verdicts, the human's choice and edit, and the inference in those fixtures are
ours, written over the records; they are not part of the dataset.

The repository has no packaging or export step today (the worker's pyproject packages `ghost_worker`
only, not fixtures/ or bench/); any future release, container image or export must exclude
fixtures/crmarena_sample/, fixtures/evals/crmarena/, bench/labels/crmarena/, web/tests/fixtures/core/medtech.*
and web/tests/fixtures/medtech/.

No other content from the following datasets is included in this repository or its fixtures:
- gong-io-research/call-playbook (Gong License: confidential, non-commercial, no redistribution)
- Salesforce/CRMArenaPro (CC BY-NC 4.0) — apart from the CRMArena fixtures above
- AST-FRI/EnterpriseBench (MIT)
- DeepMostInnovations/saas-sales-conversations (Apache 2.0)
Local copies, if present, live in the git-ignored data/ directory for reference only.
